<title>USA: Honda Sept domestic-built US car sales up.</title>
<headline>Honda Sept domestic-built US car sales up.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honda Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p>			Sep 1-30, 1996     Sep 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    54,744	    44,264	    +28.8</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   2,021	     2,097	     +0.4</p>
<p> Import Car		 8,319	    20,490	    -57.7</p>
<p> Import Truck	     2,003	     2,331	    -10.5</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Sep 30, 1996 Jan 1-Sep 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   500,951	   366,620	    +36.0</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  21,805	    20,780	     +4.5</p>
<p> Import Car		85,470	   189,211	    -55.0</p>
<p> Import Truck	    24,199	    18,866	    +27.7</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 231 for year to date vs 230 in year ago.</p>
</text>
